abstract: >-
  Experimental research repository for BIP-39 mnemonic generation, entropy
  construction and accounting, SHA-256 checksum analysis, deterministic
  prime-number positional mappings, absolute-coordinate models, structural
  filters, Bitcoin wallet derivation utilities, reproducibility tooling,
  automated tests, and machine-readable public research datasets.
